&lt;li&gt;Work alongside SLT at Leading Businesses: You will be engaging with Senior Leadership and C-Level executives at the leading retail brands, getting exposure to how the top companies operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Customer Facing Expert: You will be working directly with customers, often meeting them in person and developing your ability to create strong interpersonal relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: we offer unique opportunities to learn from and collaborate with every department in the business — many daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Training: In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Account Management, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real Mentorship: Regular one-to-ones, feedback, and career conversations with people invested in your progression, not just your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career Development: High performers have clear opportunities to quickly advance their careers at Fospha — whether progressing within our Customer Teams toward strategic and/or management roles or moving into other departments that align with your skills and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Tools: Hands-on exposure to Gen AI tooling through our Gen AI hub, so you&#39;re building modern, AI-fluent ways of working rather than legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £34k + discretionary 10% bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace pension ~~through Royal London~~, with Fospha matching your contributions up to 3%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up - whatever suits you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday! and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary, from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme, plus discounts on everyday spending through our benefits portal — Apple, Tesco, IKEA, M&amp;amp;S, Deliveroo, cinema tickets and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly one-to-one sessions with a financial adviser, plus access to payroll-deducted loans through Salary Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We hire for potential – you don’t need a technical degree or marketing background. We’re looking for:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive individuals who are keen to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building ability, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, comfortable interpreting data and creating insights – proficiency in Excel!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and able to manage multiple priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving problems for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in emerging technologies and excited by the potential and opportunity AI brings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity: We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be hear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together: We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow: We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer at the heart: We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candour with caring: We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&quot;&gt;recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":385839,"name":"Early Careers","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":10838,"name":"Fospha - London","location":"London W6 9DL, United Kingdom","child_ids":[],"parent_id":301135}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/blenheimchalcot/jobs/8207802","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3552393,"location":{"name":"London"},"metadata":[{"id":56064,"name":"Business","value":"Fospha","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8207802,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T10:05:10-04:00","requisition_id":"1620","title":"Graduate Data Engineer","company_name":"Blenheim Chalcot","first_published":"2026-09-16T10:05:10-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Adanola and Huel use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform — and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha&#39;s measurement products run on data pipelines that process marketing spend and performance data for brands you&#39;ll recognise. You&#39;ll get exposure across our core data engineering workstreams: large-scale SQL/dbt transformation pipelines, data ingestion services, and pipelines that turn aggregated data into insights served through APIs. You&#39;ll work alongside data engineers, analysts, and AI agents as part of our AI-first operating model, with senior engineers supporting you as you build real ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits a recent graduate (or someone with a strong personal/academic project record) who&#39;s curious about data pipelines and wants to learn by shipping real, production code from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain dbt models and SQL as part of our production data engineering pipelines, learning the transformation patterns we build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and maintain Python-based data ingestion services, with guidance from senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to pipelines that move data from ingestion through transformation to the APIs that serve it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, tested code and get comfortable with code review from both sides — giving and receiving feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug data quality issues systematically, learning to trace problems back through the pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get exposure to our cloud infrastructure and understand how it supports the pipelines you work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with AI agents as part of our AI-first operating model, learning to write clear specifications that shape high-quality, AI-assisted engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data engineers, analysts, and product stakeholders to understand what the data needs to support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Centre of Excellence&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Centre of Excellence is Fospha&#39;s early-careers programme that develops ambitious, high-performing talent through focused training, hands-on experience and cross-functional exposure. Starting in Data Engineering, you&#39;ll gain foundational experience while being prepared for future opportunities across the organisation. The programme operates on the following principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Responsibility from the Get-go: &lt;/strong&gt;You will quickly be responsible for the success of your work, able to make an individual impact early in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work alongside SLT at Leading Businesses: &lt;/strong&gt;You will be engaging with Senior Leadership and C-Level executives at the leading retail brands, getting exposure to how the top companies operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: &lt;/strong&gt;we offer unique opportunities to learn from and collaborate with every department in the business — many daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Training: &lt;/strong&gt;In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Account Management, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Mentorship: &lt;/strong&gt;Regular one-to-ones, feedback, and career conversations with people invested in your progression, not just your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Development: &lt;/strong&gt;High performers have clear opportunities to quickly advance their careers at Fospha — whether progressing within Data Engineering toward senior technical and/or leadership roles or moving into other departments that align with their skills and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Tools: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on exposure to Gen AI tooling and AI-assisted coding (we use Claude Code day-to-day), so you&#39;re building modern, AI-fluent ways of working rather than legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relevant degree (Computer Science, Data Engineering, Mathematics, or similar), or equivalent experience through internships/placements/personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with SQL and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about how data pipelines work end-to-end, not just the code but why the data looks the way it does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable being reviewed and iterating quickly on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident asking questions and pushing for clarity rather than staying blocked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to dbt or another SQL transformation framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Git/GitHub and PR-based workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some exposure to AWS or another cloud environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing or maintaining automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI-assisted coding tools (we use Claude Code day-to-day)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any exposure to marketing, ecommerce, or advertising data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive + bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up — whatever suits you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday, and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Fospha&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real production impact from day one. The pipelines you help build feed measurement products used to make real budget decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A published career framework. No guessing what the next level requires or when you&#39;ll get there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that reviews each other&#39;s work properly. Code review from people who care about getting the data right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first operating model where lean, high-autonomy teams ship fast and learn faster — with structured mentorship from senior engineers as you build that fluency yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity: &lt;/strong&gt;We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together: &lt;/strong&gt;We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow: &lt;/strong&gt;We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer at the heart: &lt;/strong&gt;We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candour with caring: &lt;/strong&gt;We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&quot;&gt;recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":385839,"name":"Early Careers","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":10838,"name":"Fospha - London","location":"London W6 9DL, United Kingdom","child_ids":[],"parent_id":301135}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/blenheimchalcot/jobs/8173322","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3537379,"location":{"name":"London, United Kingdom"},"metadata":[{"id":56064,"name":"Business","value":"Blenheim Chalcot UK","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8173322,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T08:23:42-04:00","requisition_id":"1610","title":"Graduate - Scale Space","company_name":"Blenheim Chalcot","first_published":"2026-09-02T08:23:42-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;h1&gt;Graduate Programme — Scale Space&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you torn between the excitement of start-ups and the stability of corporate life?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you keen to continue learning and developing skills whilst experiencing how to build businesses?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you looking for a role that will offer the opportunity to experience first-hand how a growing business operates, while being supported to take ownership of work that matters?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you and you are up for the challenge, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking to hire high-energy, entrepreneurial and value-adding graduate talent to join Blenheim Chalcot in a role dedicated entirely to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;, one of the businesses within the Blenheim Chalcot portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure. Our ventures are at the forefront of a multitude of industries being disrupted by digital, including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media, Sport, Charity and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are highly entrepreneurial and seek opportunities where digital technologies can disrupt major markets. Ventures we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance, Modulr and the Rajasthan Royals cricket team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Many of the companies within the portfolio have materialised from ideas conceived and launched by us, and we have over 4,000 employees supporting their growth and development. Our assets under management stand at more than £1.8bn and total portfolio revenue is over £500 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We work closely with investment and strategic partners including PayPal, FIS, L&amp;amp;G, Tencent, Experian, Google, Worldpay, Imperial College and some of the leading venture capital and private equity companies internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our central team, Venture Builder Services (VBS), exists to support our ventures to be successful quickly, sustainably and with access to best-practice tools, solutions and expertise. We provide a range of services to help new businesses get off the ground, including technology, growth, talent, finance, legal and tax.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;IMPACT BEYOND PROFIT&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;15% of our partnerships and ventures are charities. These include the British Asian Trust, Babyzone and OnSide Youth Zones. In the same way that we support our ventures, our Partners provide direct hands-on support to these charities by being active board members and offering expert advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT SCALE SPACE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Scale Space is a community and workspace designed to bring together ambitious businesses, entrepreneurs, scale-ups and innovators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Based in White City, Scale Space provides more than just flexible workspace. It creates an environment where growing businesses can connect, collaborate and access the networks, expertise and opportunities they need to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The team works across community, events, partnerships, operations and customer experience to ensure that members receive a high-quality experience while helping to build a connected and ambitious business community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced and progressive environment while working exclusively with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will be embedded within the Scale Space team and contribute to meaningful projects across the business, while benefiting from Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning, development and employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated to Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your role will sit fully within Scale Space. Your day-to-day work, projects and objectives will be focused entirely on supporting Scale Space and its growth, giving you the opportunity to build deep experience within a fast-moving and entrepreneurial business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– we pride ourselves on having an intentional and continuous learning and development culture at Blenheim Chalcot. You will have access to BC learning and development opportunities designed to strengthen your core professional, commercial and leadership skills, while applying that learning directly to your work at Scale Space. You will learn by doing, taking on real responsibility and developing quickly within the Scale Space team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Careers Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– as a BC graduate, you will have access to structured development opportunities designed for those early in their careers. These will support your professional growth while your substantive role remains fully dedicated to Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you will be part of the wider BC graduate community, with access to relevant learning sessions, networking opportunities and socials. This community is intended to support your development and connection with fellow graduates; your substantive role and day-to-day responsibilities will remain entirely within Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you will be given meaningful responsibility from the outset and supported to take ownership of work that matters. Rather than rotating between businesses, you will build continuity and depth within Scale Space and see the direct impact of your work on the business, its members and the wider community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ARE YOU BC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are not expecting you to have worked in start-ups before or to have studied a tech-related degree. For us, it is about hiring the right person and their potential, not just their experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As such, we are looking for graduates from any discipline. Different areas of expertise bring valuable new perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people when hiring into the BC Group. We look for people who are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– people in BC are inquisitive. They want to understand ‘why’ and consider whether there is a better approach rather than simply accepting ‘it’s how we’ve always done it’. Given our ethos is all about disrupting industries with new methods and products, curiosity is at the heart of what we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‘Doers’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– we are a community of proactive self-starters. We will provide full support to our graduates, but we look for people who can use their initiative, take ownership and drive work forward on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– working in a growth business environment is ambiguous, diverse and, at times, chaotic by definition. Being adaptable and recognising the importance of flexibility in order to add value in a constantly evolving company is vital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiasm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you do not need to be a ‘techy’ at heart to work in our environment. We are looking for people who are enthusiastic about innovation, growth and the changing nature of industries, with a desire to work in an environment where new and challenging things happen every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– building and scaling businesses is never easy. As such, we have a ‘no-ego’ policy and seek out people who bring energy to a team rather than drain it. We have a down-to-earth and personable culture; we solve complex problems but do not take ourselves too seriously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you see yourself in this and would like to work with similarly minded people, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT WE CAN OFFER YOU AS A BC EMPLOYEE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the UK’s leading digital venture builder and have the opportunity to learn from the incredible talent across BC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be exposed to the right mix of challenge, responsibility and learning and development opportunities while building deep, hands-on experience within Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fun and open, if a little cricket-obsessed, atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid holiday plus your birthday off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance, Pension Scheme and Cycle to Work Scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Benefits including Private Medical and Dental cover and gym subsidies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;APPLICATION &amp;amp; PROCESS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you are keen to apply, please submit your CV and a member of our Talent Team will contact you with next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We have a rigorous recruitment process, which we use for all our roles to ensure we attract the very best talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We have a three-stage process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Telephone interview with a member of the BC Talent Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Virtual assessment day, consisting of both individual and group activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 3:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Final interviews with Blenheim Chalcot and Scale Space at Scale Space, White City.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the timeframes provided above are subject to change. Any changes will be communicated throughout the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values and is central to our business. We strive to maximise the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We encourage diversity of perspective, background, identity and thought, while fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
