&lt;li&gt;A STEM or Economics graduate (or equivalent analytical background)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by solving problems methodically, not just ticking boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident communicator, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in learning SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who builds trust easily, with clients and colleagues alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in the detail — Excel-proficient and not afraid of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised enough to juggle multiple client priorities without dropping the ball&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely excited about where AI and emerging tech are taking this industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity:&lt;/strong&gt; We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together:&lt;/strong&gt; We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow:&lt;/strong&gt; We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer at the heart:&lt;/strong&gt; We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candour with caring:&lt;/strong&gt; We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&quot;&gt;recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":385839,"name":"Early Careers","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":86782,"name":"Fospha - Austin","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":301135}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/blenheimchalcot/jobs/8207847","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3552430,"location":{"name":"London"},"metadata":[{"id":56064,"name":"Business","value":"Fospha","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8207847,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T10:23:30-04:00","requisition_id":"1621","title":"Junior Software Engineer","company_name":"Blenheim Chalcot","first_published":"2026-09-16T10:23:30-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Adanola and Huel use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform — and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha&#39;s measurement products run on data pipelines that process marketing spend and performance data for brands you&#39;ll recognise. You&#39;ll get exposure across our core data engineering workstreams: large-scale SQL/dbt transformation pipelines, data ingestion services, and pipelines that turn aggregated data into insights served through APIs. You&#39;ll work alongside data engineers, analysts, and AI agents as part of our AI-first operating model, with senior engineers supporting you as you build real ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits a recent graduate (or someone with a strong personal/academic project record) who&#39;s curious about data pipelines and wants to learn by shipping real, production code from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain dbt models and SQL as part of our production data engineering pipelines, learning the transformation patterns we build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and maintain Python-based data ingestion services, with guidance from senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to pipelines that move data from ingestion through transformation to the APIs that serve it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, tested code and get comfortable with code review from both sides — giving and receiving feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug data quality issues systematically, learning to trace problems back through the pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get exposure to our cloud infrastructure and understand how it supports the pipelines you work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with AI agents as part of our AI-first operating model, learning to write clear specifications that shape high-quality, AI-assisted engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data engineers, analysts, and product stakeholders to understand what the data needs to support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Centre of Excellence&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Centre of Excellence is Fospha&#39;s early-careers programme that develops ambitious, high-performing talent through focused training, hands-on experience and cross-functional exposure. Starting in Data Engineering, you&#39;ll gain foundational experience while being prepared for future opportunities across the organisation. The programme operates on the following principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Responsibility from the Get-go: &lt;/strong&gt;You will quickly be responsible for the success of your work, able to make an individual impact early in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work alongside SLT at Leading Businesses: &lt;/strong&gt;You will be engaging with Senior Leadership and C-Level executives at the leading retail brands, getting exposure to how the top companies operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: &lt;/strong&gt;we offer unique opportunities to learn from and collaborate with every department in the business — many daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Training: &lt;/strong&gt;In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Account Management, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Mentorship: &lt;/strong&gt;Regular one-to-ones, feedback, and career conversations with people invested in your progression, not just your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Development: &lt;/strong&gt;High performers have clear opportunities to quickly advance their careers at Fospha — whether progressing within Data Engineering toward senior technical and/or leadership roles or moving into other departments that align with their skills and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Tools: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on exposure to Gen AI tooling and AI-assisted coding (we use Claude Code day-to-day), so you&#39;re building modern, AI-fluent ways of working rather than legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relevant degree (Computer Science, Data Engineering, Mathematics, or similar), or equivalent experience through internships/placements/personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with SQL and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about how data pipelines work end-to-end, not just the code but why the data looks the way it does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable being reviewed and iterating quickly on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident asking questions and pushing for clarity rather than staying blocked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to dbt or another SQL transformation framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Git/GitHub and PR-based workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some exposure to AWS or another cloud environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing or maintaining automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI-assisted coding tools (we use Claude Code day-to-day)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any exposure to marketing, ecommerce, or advertising data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive + bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up — whatever suits you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday, and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Fospha&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real production impact from day one. The pipelines you help build feed measurement products used to make real budget decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A published career framework. No guessing what the next level requires or when you&#39;ll get there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that reviews each other&#39;s work properly. Code review from people who care about getting the data right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first operating model where lean, high-autonomy teams ship fast and learn faster — with structured mentorship from senior engineers as you build that fluency yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity: &lt;/strong&gt;We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together: &lt;/strong&gt;We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow: &lt;/strong&gt;We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer at the heart: &lt;/strong&gt;We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candour with caring: &lt;/strong&gt;We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&quot;&gt;recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":291698,"name":"Engineering","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":10838,"name":"Fospha - London","location":"London W6 9DL, United Kingdom","child_ids":[],"parent_id":301135}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/blenheimchalcot/jobs/8300774","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3589101,"location":{"name":"London, United Kingdom"},"metadata":[{"id":56064,"name":"Business","value":"Fospha","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8300774,"updated_at":"2026-10-20T04:53:36-04:00","requisition_id":"1641","title":"Multi-Disciplinary Designer ","company_name":"Blenheim Chalcot","first_published":"2026-10-19T10:22:30-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fospha.com/&quot;&gt;Fospha&lt;/a&gt; is the marketing measurement system for brands that sell everywhere. For over a decade, we&#39;ve helped paid marketing teams see everything, sell anywhere and move instantly, so they can stop defending their budget and start growing it profitably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today&#39;s brands don&#39;t only sell on their own website. They sell through retailers like Sephora, Ulta and Amazon, and in physical stores. Fospha measures all of it, online and offline, from daily full-funnel attribution to planning, testing and AI-powered analysis. We&#39;ve optimised over &lt;strong&gt;$40B&lt;/strong&gt; in marketing spend, and we&#39;re scaling fast across &lt;strong&gt;London, Mumbai, and Austin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent, in-house role for a multi-disciplinary designer at the heart of Fospha&#39;s go-to-market motion. The work is deliberately varied: in a single week you might refine our website, design a sales asset for a major prospect, and extend our design system. We&#39;re looking for a versatile all-rounder with real depth across brand, web and presentation design, not a specialist in just one of them. You&#39;ll be the person who defines what &quot;best in class&quot; looks like for our brand, then makes it real: a dynamic, memorable website, standout sales and event materials, and a design system that lets the whole team move at pace without losing quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your job is to make sure the imagery, motion and feel of Fospha land the pain points of our target enterprise brands as clearly as our words do, and to translate complex measurement concepts into visuals that are instantly easy to understand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll sit in the Marketing team and work closely with Sales, Product Marketing, Product and our leadership. This is an &lt;strong&gt;office-based role&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll be in the room for conversations on product, marketing and customer decks, so you deeply understand our customers, our product, and where and how we sell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits someone who loves ideation and is excited to work in a fast-paced, innovative startup environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll work on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your time will be spread across four areas, so you&#39;ll have variety without losing focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Focus area&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;What it covers&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;High-value assets&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Ad hoc, high-impact pieces: sales materials, enterprise and keynote decks, event assets&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Fospha website and brand&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Front-end website design and maintenance, and the evolution of the Fospha brand&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Media partner website and brand&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Look and feel and web maintenance for Fospha’s media partner&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Design system on Claude Design&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Creating and maintaining the design system that lets us scale deck-creation and story-telling faster&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level up our brand through the website.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the design of the Fospha front-end website and keep it improving: a dynamic, interactive site with illustrations that are easy to read, colour that guides the eye, and a feel that tells enterprise brands we are the mature, trusted choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own our media partner’s look and feel.&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and maintain the brand and website for our media partners, keeping it distinctive and consistent while it works alongside Fospha.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create high-value assets.&lt;/strong&gt; Design the pieces that win deals and make an impression: sales collateral, enterprise decks, keynote presentations and event materials, where both quality and speed matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn complex ideas into imagery.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate measurement concepts, such as why one methodology alone is not enough, into bespoke illustrations and visuals that a buyer grasps in seconds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain our design system on Claude Design.&lt;/strong&gt; Create a richer, more dynamic system that lets the wider team produce on-brand decks and materials at scale, and keep it sharp as the brand evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the owner of taste.&lt;/strong&gt; Review work against the brand standard, spot what doesn&#39;t feel like Fospha, and direct AI tools so what they produce is genuinely good, not just fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep raising the bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Benchmark us against the best in B2B measurement and beyond, bring fresh ideas on what the best looks like, and keep improving how we show up against competitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to the business.&lt;/strong&gt; Understand our ICP, product, and how and where we sell, so your design decisions are always tied to commercial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire for potential and taste. You should apply if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a &lt;strong&gt;genuine multi-disciplinary designer&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable moving between brand, web, illustration and presentation work, with a portfolio that shows range as well as craft, rather than deep expertise in only one area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an &lt;strong&gt;innovative, keen design eye&lt;/strong&gt; and a portfolio that shows distinctive brand, web and illustration work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand &lt;strong&gt;how a strong B2B brand in the measurement and analytics space is built&lt;/strong&gt;, and can articulate what makes the best ones feel credible, modern and memorable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can &lt;strong&gt;translate complex concepts into clear, compelling imagery&lt;/strong&gt;, with a skilful use of colour, illustration and layout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong &lt;strong&gt;website design skills&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with a feel for interaction, motion and scroll-driven storytelling, and are comfortable working closely with front-end builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;agentically minded&lt;/strong&gt;: you love experimenting with new tools for image generation and AI-assisted design, and know when to push them and when to take over&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive on ideation&lt;/strong&gt;, constantly asking what the best looks like in marketing and how we can level up our brand against competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced, innovative startup environment&lt;/strong&gt;, where you&#39;ll ship quickly, iterate often, and juggle several projects at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;commercially curious&lt;/strong&gt;: you care about who our buyers are, why they choose us, and how design helps win enterprise brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are keen to work &lt;strong&gt;in the office&lt;/strong&gt; and be part of every conversation, from product to marketing to customer decks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity:&lt;/strong&gt; We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together:&lt;/strong&gt; We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow:&lt;/strong&gt; We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer at the heart:&lt;/strong&gt; We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candour with caring:&lt;/strong&gt; We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent role in a fast-growing business, with real ownership over how our brand looks and feels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a leading global venture builder, &lt;a href=&quot;https://blenheimchalcot.com/blog&quot;&gt;Blenheim Chalcot&lt;/a&gt;, and learn from the incredible talent in BC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The right mix of challenges, learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible benefits including Private Medical and Dental, Gym Subsidies, Life Assurance, and Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid holiday + your birthday off!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free snacks in the office!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly team socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top tip: Include a portfolio with your application, and tell us how you&#39;d make Fospha&#39;s brand stand out to enterprise retail brands.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&quot;&gt;recruitment@blenheimchalcot.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":16592,"name":"Marketing & Comms ","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":10838,"name":"Fospha - London","location":"London W6 9DL, United Kingdom","child_ids":[],"parent_id":301135}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null}],"meta":{"total":13}}

{"jobs":[{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/blenheimchalcotindia/jobs/7699027","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"education":"education_optional","internal_job_id":3384222,"location":{"name":"Mumbai, Maharashtra, India"},"metadata":[{"id":56064,"name":"Business","value":"Blenheim Chalcot India","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":7699027,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:04:16-04:00","requisition_id":"1469","title":"AI Application Packaging Engineer ","company_name":"Blenheim Chalcot India","first_published":"2026-03-10T09:58:31-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Title:&lt;/span&gt; AI Application Packaging Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Andheri (East), Mumbai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reports to: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT BLENHEIM CHALCOT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Blenheim Chalcot portfolio, we benefit from the expertise, infrastructure, and scale of the leading global venture builder. With over 25 years of experience creating and growing SaaS businesses powered by Generative AI, Blenheim Chalcot has built 60+ ventures across sectors such as financial services, education, health, and marketing. Our global ecosystem—including Scale Space in London, the Rajasthan Royals in Mumbai, and a go-to-market base in Austin—enables us to access world-class talent, tools, and support to accelerate our growth and build a market-leading business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an AI-first ITS Engineer with strong Application Packaging expertise to join our growing team at Agilisys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll work across Application Packaging, Endpoint Management, Cloud Deployment, and Automation, helping modernise IT operations through AI-driven and scalable solutions. This is an opportunity to work in a fast-paced environment where automation, innovation, and operational efficiency are at the core of what we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have&#39;s&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience with SCCM and/or Microsoft Intune for application packaging, deployment, and endpoint management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Strong experience with PowerShell scripting and a good understanding of Windows Registry, File System internals, and deployment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Experience managing application packaging, deployment, patching, and remediation processes in enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Exposure to vulnerability management and patch lifecycle activities using tools such as WSUS, Active Directory, or endpoint security solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;An AI-first mindset with interest or experience leveraging Generative AI tools to improve efficiency across packaging, testing, deployment, troubleshooting, and operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using automation or AI-assisted tools to streamline IT operations and deployment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Experience with InstallShield, ORCA, VBScript, or related packaging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Microsoft or vendor certifications (Intune, SCCM, Windows, Azure, ITIL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise or regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsolistparagraph&quot;&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; Mindset: We will hire, assess, and manage you on behaviours as much as technical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsolistparagraph&quot;&gt;High Agency: You solve problems before they’re reported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsolistparagraph&quot;&gt;Ownership: You deliver end-to-end outcomes, not just closed tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsolistparagraph&quot;&gt;Outcome-Driven: You obsess over metrics like Patch Hygiene and Zero-Rework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsolistparagraph&quot;&gt;Communicator: You can explain complex technical risks to UK-based stakeholders with ease.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Clear, structured, empathetic updates across tech and business audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsolistparagraph&quot;&gt;Collaboration: Support others, adapt under pressure, maintain team morale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROCESS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;Process - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;We have a rigorous, but streamlined recruitment process, which respects the time of candidates and portfolio companies alike. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;Please note that our roles are primarily office based, with modern and well-connected office location in Andheri East.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values, thus making it core to our business. We strive to maximize the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone. We encourage diversity through perspective, background, identity, and thought whilst also fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of your race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We are committed to continuing to nurture an inclusive environment and building a diverse workforce.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-PS1&lt;/p&gt;","departments":[{"id":16591,"name":"IT & Infrastructure ","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":258050,"name":"Agilisys - Mumbai","location":"Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra, India","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/blenheimchalcotindia/jobs/8239023","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3565123,"location":{"name":"Mumbai, India"},"metadata":[{"id":56064,"name":"Business","value":"Blenheim Chalcot India","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8239023,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T01:52:59-04:00","requisition_id":"1625","title":"Collections Associate","company_name":"Blenheim Chalcot India","first_published":"2026-09-29T01:41:58-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Blenheim Chalcot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is one of the leading venture builders in the world. We have been building exciting and disruptive businesses for over 26 years across sectors including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media, Sport, Charity and more. These companies are all GenAI enabled and are some of the most innovative companies in the UK and increasingly around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The BC team in India has been instrumental to the growth and success of Blenheim Chalcot. Established in 2014, Blenheim Chalcot India serves as a pivotal launchpad for those aiming to make a difference in the realm of innovation and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Blenheim Chalcot India is driven by a mission to empower visionaries to lead, innovate, and build disruptive solutions. We support our diverse portfolio of ventures and create impactful solutions that shape global trends. We provide a range of services to help new business get off the ground, including technology, growth (marketing and sales), talent, HR, finance, legal and tax, plus so much more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our FinTech ventures, Salary Finance is scaling fast and we’re looking to hire high energy, motivated and curious talent to support them on that journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Salary Finance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary Finance is a leading global FinTech platform. We support a community of 4M employees across 575 clients (including 20% of the FTSE 100) in the UK and US, providing a suite of financial employee benefits that help employees improve their financial health and happiness. Our platform provides salary-linked savings, loans, pay advances, and financial education. We have a team of 200 brilliant and passionate colleagues across 3 countries, backed by great investors (Blenheim Chalcot, Legal &amp;amp; General, Experian, Goldman Sachs, Royal London, Virgin Money) with £100M in equity and £500M in debt funding raised to date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were co-founded by entrepreneurs Asesh Sarkar (CEO), Daniel Shakhani, and former Head of Google UK and Ireland Dan Cobley (Chairman), and are authorised by the FCA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Collections Associate to join our Customer Operations team. The ideal candidate will have previous experience in frontline collections and be confident handling customers across multiple channels, while balancing effective collections strategies with a customer-focused approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for managing collections-related enquiries via Email and Live Chat, supporting the back-office processes that underpin the collections function, and ensuring all interactions and records are handled accurately, empathetically, and in line with regulatory and internal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage frontline Collections operations, including customer accounts in arrears and repayment-related enquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer enquiries across Email and Live Chat, providing clear, accurate, and empathetic support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply appropriate collections strategies and processes within a FinTech or financial services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customers experiencing financial difficulty or vulnerability, following appropriate vulnerability and affordability processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and respond appropriately to financial hardship, vulnerability, and potential customer risk indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue legal notices and collections-related documentation in line with regulatory and internal requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage shared inboxes, ensuring customer emails are actioned professionally and within SLA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and comprehensive customer account records, case notes, and communications within internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use CRM and case management tools to manage customer interactions, account updates, and follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation and maintenance of collections reports, trackers, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with monitoring inactive and underperforming accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with internal teams to resolve complex collections cases and customer queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all customer interactions comply with regulatory requirements, company policies, data protection standards, and collections procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve customer journeys and contribute to process and knowledge improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate ownership of cases, ensuring appropriate follow-up and timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet quality, productivity, customer experience, and operational targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in frontline Collections operations, preferably within FinTech, banking, lending, or financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of collections strategies, arrears management, and customer repayment journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling customers through Email and Live Chat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of supporting vulnerable customers and customers experiencing financial hardship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience using CRM/case management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing back-office collections processes, documentation, and reporting alongside customer contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex information clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a commitment to maintaining accurate customer records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle sensitive or challenging customer conversations with empathy, professionalism, and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and decision-making skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player who is willing to support colleagues and take ownership of shared objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, technology-driven environment and adapting to changing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic to intermediate Excel skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means consistently delivering effective collections outcomes while maintaining a high standard of customer care, quality, compliance, and operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the World’s Leading Digital Venture Builder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the opportunity to be a part of and learn from the incredible diverse talent in BC&lt;/li&gt;
